    12	## Artifact Description
    13	### Purpose
    14	The artifact is about a controlled experiment aimed at investigating the extent to which Pythonic functional constructs have an impact on source code understandability. The artifact archive contains:
    15	
    16	1. The material to allow replicating the study (see Section [Experimental-Material](#material))
